Subject: [PATCH 6.1 1021/1146] ethtool: avoiding integer overflow in ethtool_phys_id()
Date: Wed, 28 Dec 2022 15:42:40 +0100
Message-Id: <20221228144358.102950763@linuxfoundation.org>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.39.0
